OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start during the morning
OL,6,Frush, with rain quicky clearing
OL,7,Fsoutheastwards. Plenty of sunshine to
OL,8,Ffollow, though the odd shower possible
OL,9,Flater further west. Remaining very
OL,10,Fmild and rather gusty over western
OL,11,Fhills.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA clear and dry night,
OL,14,Ffeeling cooler than last night but
OL,15,Fstill mild for the time of year. Winds
OL,16,Feasing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
