OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FPlenty of sunshine around
OL,6,Fto start on Wednesday. Still feeling
OL,7,Fmild, with cloud building through the
OL,8,Fmorning. Winds strengthening through
OL,9,Fthe morning with again, stronger gusts
OL,10,Fover the hills.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Fdry start to Thursday, before a band
OL,14,Fof rain pushes southeastwards into
OL,15,FFriday, feeling markedly cooler in its
OL,16,Fwake with sunny spells and showers. A
OL,17,Fsunny, more settled weekend.??
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
